<</Author(Xilinx, Inc.)/CreationDate(D:20100309015105-08'00')/Creator(FrameMaker 10.0.2)/Keywords("ds827,827,Spartan,Virtex,IP,Xilinx,AXI,AXI-Lite,AMBA,Kintex-7, K7, Artix, Artix-7, A7, V6, Virtex-6, Spartan-6, V6, S6, V7, Virtex-7")/ModDate(D:20120716121841-07'00')/Producer(Acrobat Distiller 9.5.1 \(Windows\))/Subject(The AXI to AHB-Lite Bridge translates AXI4 transactions into AHB-Lite transactions. It functions as a slave on the AXI4 interface and as a master on the AHB-Lite interface. The AXI to AHB-Lite Bridge main use model is to connect the AHB-Lite slaves with A\
XI masters.)/Title(Xilinx DS827 LogiCORE IP AXI to AHB-Lite Bridge \(v1.01a\), Data Sheet)>>
